                <pb facs="0341" n="257" sameAs="frus:frus1886/pg257"/>

                <head>No. 104.<lb/><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Bayard to Mr. Beach</hi></head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Department of State</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1885-05-05"><hi rendition="#italic">May</hi> 5,
                        1885</date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>We hold Santos’s citizenship fully established and not debatable, and expect
                    treatment accordingly. Wachusett will soon return Guayaquil bearing full
                    instructions.</p>
                <closer><signed>BAYARD.</signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
